<view class="page">
  <view class="orange-header">
    <view class="head-title">竞招岗位需付费发布</view>
    <view class="head-tip">?</view>
  </view>

  <view class="package-card">
    <view class="left">
      <view class="big">竞招岗位套餐</view>
      <view class="sub">购买后到期自动续接</view>
    </view>
    <view class="right-icon">🛡️</view>
  </view>

  <view class="refund-row">
    <view class="refund-label">无报名全额退</view>
    <view class="refund-link">遇到问题？咨询客服 ›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="tier-list">
    <view
      class="tier {{selectedDuration === 'D30' ? 'selected' : ''}}"
      bindtap="onPickDuration"
      data-d="D30"
    >
      <view class="tier-radio">
        <view class="dot {{selectedDuration === 'D30' ? 'dot-active' : ''}}"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="tier-body">
        <view class="tier-name">月卡 30 天</view>
        <view class="tier-note">套餐结束后，收不到报名，全额退款</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tier-price">
        <view class="price-main">¥{{price.D30}}</view>
        <view class="price-sub">折合 {{perDayPrice.D30}} 元/天</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view
      class="tier {{selectedDuration === 'D90' ? 'selected' : ''}}"
      bindtap="onPickDuration"
      data-d="D90"
    >
      <view class="tier-radio">
        <view class="dot {{selectedDuration === 'D90' ? 'dot-active' : ''}}"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="tier-body">
        <view class="tier-name">季卡 90 天</view>
        <view class="tier-note">套餐结束后，收不到报名，全额退款</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tier-price">
        <view class="price-main">¥{{price.D90}}</view>
        <view class="price-sub">折合 {{perDayPrice.D90}} 元/天</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice" bindtap="toggleNotice">
    <view class="notice-title">购买须知</view>
    <view class="notice-list" wx:if="{{noticeOpen}}">
      <view class="notice-item">1. 购买成功后，在套餐生效周期内可发布相应数量的竞招岗位</view>
      <view class="notice-item">2. 套餐售价根据购买档位、职类、地区等因素产生波动，最终价格以购买前平台显示为准</view>
      <view class="notice-item">3. 在套餐生效周期内，再次购买的竞招岗位套餐作为续费套餐，将在上一个套餐到期后自动续接</view>
      <view class="notice-item">4. 竞招岗位达到在线职位数上限后，若您还需要发布新职位，可暂停已有职位或购买竞招岗位加油包获得更多在线职位数</view>
      <view class="notice-item">5. 该产品属于数字化商品，不支持七天无理由退款</view>
      <view class="notice-item">6. 如有问题请联系客服</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="spacer"></view>

  <view class="pay-bar">
    <view class="pay-bar-left">
      <view class="pay-bar-price">¥{{currentPrice}}</view>
      <view class="pay-bar-tag">
        <text wx:if="{{selectedDuration === 'D30'}}">月卡 30 天</text>
        <text wx:else>季卡 90 天</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="pay-bar-btn {{paying ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onPay">
      {{paying ? '支付中…' : '立即支付'}}
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
